    "long_instructions": "## Switching Between Models\r\n\r\nThis tool has two base models: _Karen the Editor_ and _Mistral Instruct_. We can use the Compare Models button to view the differences between them.\r\n\r\nTo change a base model, use the dropdown to update the model and then press the Update button to save the configuration.\r\n\r\n### Do This\r\n\r\n1) Ask _Karen the Editor_ for advice on how to make a sentence more creative, then change to the _Mistral Instruct_ model and have the same conversation\r\n    - Was one model more helpful than the other?\r\n2) Ask a **question about a book or movie** to the _Mistral Instruct_ model, then change to the _Karen the Editor_ model and ask the same question\r\n    - How were the responses different? Was one better than the other?",
    "display_name": "Karen the Editor",
